<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>Privacy Policy - BhakthiVedanta Wisdom Contest 2026</title>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e3f2fd 0%, #bbdefb 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a237e 0%, #283593 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 50px 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .header p {
            font-size: 15px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 50px 50px 60px;
        }

        .content p {
            color: #37474f;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .section {
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        .section h3 {
            color: #1a237e;
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .section ul {
            margin-left: 25px;
            color: #546e7a;
            line-height: 1.9;
        }

        .section li {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .back-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            color: #1a237e;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            background: rgba(26, 35, 126, 0.08);
            border-radius: 30px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .back-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(26, 35, 126, 0.15);
            transform: translateX(-5px);
        }

        .footer-note {
            text-align: center;
            color: #78909c;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding-top: 30px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .content, .header {
                padding: 40px 30px;
            }

            .header h1 {
                font-size: 26px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            body {
                padding: 20px 15px;
            }

            .content, .header {
                padding: 30px 25px;
            }

            .header h1 {
                font-size: 22px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <a href="/" class="back-btn">← Back to Home</a>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p>Last Updated: February 2026</p>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <p>
                Welcome to BhakthiVedanta Wisdom Contest 2026. We are committed to protecting your personal information 
                and your right to privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your data.
            </p>

            <div class="section">
                <h3>Information We Collect</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Personal Information:</strong> Name, email address, phone number, and payment details</li>
                    <li><strong>Contest Submissions:</strong> Artwork, essays, recordings, and other creative content</li>
                    <li><strong>Technical Data:</strong> IP address, browser type, and device information</li>
                    <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> How you interact with our platform</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h3>How We Use Your Information</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>To process your registration and participation in contests</li>
                    <li>To communicate important updates about the contest</li>
                    <li>To process payments securely through our payment gateway</li>
                    <li>To evaluate submissions and determine winners</li>
                    <li>To improve our platform and services</li>
                    <li>To comply with legal obligations</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h3>Data Security</h3>
                <p>
                    We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your personal information. 
                    All data is encrypted during transmission using SSL/TLS protocols. Payment information is 
                    processed securely through our trusted payment partner and is never stored on our servers.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h3>Data Sharing</h3>
                <p>
                    We do not sell your personal information to third parties. We may share your information with:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Payment processors for secure transaction processing</li>
                    <li>Email service providers for contest communications</li>
                    <li>Contest judges (only submission content, not personal details)</li>
                    <li>Legal authorities if required by law</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h3>Your Rights</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Access and review your personal information</li>
                    <li>Request correction of inaccurate data</li>
                    <li>Request deletion of your data (subject to legal requirements)</li>
                    <li>Withdraw consent for marketing communications</li>
                    <li>Lodge a complaint with data protection authorities</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h3>Contact Us</h3>
                <p>
                    For any privacy-related questions or concerns, please contact us at:<br>
                    <strong>Email:</strong> support@iskconcontest.org<br>
                    <strong>Phone:</strong> +91-9493805059
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="footer-note">
                <p>© 2026 BhakthiVedanta Wisdom Contest. All Rights Reserved.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
